'''Battle Cats Rangers''' (にゃんこレンジャー, ''Nyanko Renjā, lit.'' '''Nyanko Ranger''') was a spin-off title of [[The Battle Cats]]/[[Nyanko Daisensou]] that started its pre-registration from April 13th, 2017 and released on April 27th, 2017. Developed by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]], Memory Inc and YD Online Corp. It was shut down on March 29th, 2019.

