==Trivia==
*Battle Cats Rangers was the first Battle Cats spin-off to be released in English. [[Kumanchu Royale]] and [[Nyanko Daibōsō]] existed prior, but only in Japanese.
*All of the names were translated from [[Nyanko Daisensou]], instead of using the names from The Battle Cats. [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dom Cat]], for instance, was known by her Japanese name Queen Cat.
*In update 1.0.5, there were many mistranslations that could be found such as Treasure names and Cat information.

